* Approximate models of the external parts (not vendor models)
* P-MOSFET, -30V, ~10mOhm @ Vgs=-4.5V, Ciss ~3nF (AO4407A/DMP3013 class)
.model PEXT VDMOS pchan Vto=-1.8 Kp=40 Rd=3m Rs=2m Rg=3 lambda=0.01
+ Cgdmax=1.2n Cgdmin=0.15n a=0.3 Cgs=2.2n Cjo=1n is=1e-10 rb=5m ksubthres=0.1
* BSS138-class small N-MOSFET
.model NEXT VDMOS nchan Vto=1.3 Kp=0.25 Rd=1 Rs=0.5 lambda=0.02
+ Cgdmax=12p Cgdmin=3p a=0.3 Cgs=25p Cjo=15p ksubthres=0.1
